        <span class="safepet-faq-icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="safepet-faq-answer">
        Packages in transit between regional sorting hubs may not receive milestone scans for 2–3 days while on long-haul transport. If your tracking has not updated for more than 5 consecutive business days, contact our support team and we will initiate an inquiry or send an immediate priority replacement.
      </div>
    </div>
